  "title": "Suriya & Vetrimaaran\u2019s film aiming for release during this time",
  "publication_date": "2025-04-17T05:30:13+00:00",
  "summary": "Vaadivaasal, the Suriya-Vetrimaaran collaboration, is being targeted for a Summer 2026 theatrical release (May or June), producer Kalaipuli S. Thanu says. The film\u2014based on Tamil Nadu\u2019s traditional sport Jallikattu\u2014faced delays during pre-production due to animatronics work. Shooting will start this year; Suriya has cleared dates and GV Prakash Kumar has recorded a song.",
  "content": "Suriya\u2019s Retro is slated for release on May 1. The film, directed by Karthik Subbaraj, also stars Pooja Hegde. Expectations are high for this action-packed love story. After Retro, Suriya will appear in a movie directed by RJ Balaji. Apart from these two, the National Award-winning actor has a film with Vetrimaaran titled Vaadivaasal.\n\nFilming should have commenced long ago, but the project has faced multiple delays. Vetrimaaran has spent considerable time on pre-production, focusing on animatronics. The latest information from producer Kalaipuli S. Thanu is that Vaadivaasal makers are aiming to bring the film to theatres during Summer 2026. The film will be released either in May or June 2026.\n\nThe shooting will kickstart this year, and Suriya has already allocated his call sheets to this flick. The musical sessions are underway, and GV Prakash Kumar already finished recording a song. Vaadivaasal is based on Tamil Nadu\u2019s most celebrated traditional sport, Jallikattu.",
