  "markdown_content": "## Upcoming releases\\n\\nSuriya\u2019s Retro is slated for release on May 1. The film, directed by Karthik Subbaraj, also stars Pooja Hegde. Expectations are high for this action-packed love story. After Retro, Suriya will appear in a movie directed by RJ Balaji. Apart from these two, the National Award-winning actor has a film with Vetrimaaran titled Vaadivaasal.\\n\\n- Retro \u2014 directed by Karthik Subbaraj; releases May 1\\n- Untitled RJ Balaji film \u2014 Suriya to appear after Retro\\n- Vaadivaasal \u2014 with director Vetrimaaran\\n\\n## Vaadivaasal \u2014 status and release\\n\\nFilming should have commenced long ago, but the project has faced multiple delays. Vetrimaaran has spent considerable time on pre-production, focusing on animatronics. The latest information from producer Kalaipuli S. Thanu is that Vaadivaasal makers are aiming to bring the film to theatres during Summer 2026. The film will be released either in May or June 2026.\\n\\n## Production details\\n\\n- Shooting is expected to kickstart this year.\\n- Suriya has already allocated his call sheets to the film.\\n- Musical sessions are underway; GV Prakash Kumar has finished recording a song.\\n\\nVaadivaasal is based on Tamil Nadu\u2019s most celebrated traditional sport, Jallikattu.",
